# Normalize all text files to LF on checkout. The protocol version-baseline guard
# (packages/protocol/tests/version-baseline.test.ts) hashes the source tree against a
# committed baseline captured on LF; a CRLF checkout (Windows with core.autocrlf=true)
# would shift every hash and fail CI on windows-latest while nothing changed. Binary
# files are auto-detected and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
